OL,3,GNEWSABishop and 50 clergy to tackle
OL,4,Amuddy assault course
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bishop of Blackburn will lead more
OL,7,Fthan 50 clergy wearing their dog
OL,8,Fcollars as they tackle a muddy assault
OL,9,Fcourse to raise money for a Harvest
OL,10,Fappeal.
OL,12,FThe Right Reverend Philip North and his
OL,13,Fpriest team will take on the challenge
OL,14,Fat the Whitehough Outdoor Centre in
OL,15,FBarley, Lancashire.
OL,17,FThe event will see them taking on a
OL,18,Fseries of obstacles to support the
OL,19,FJehovah Rapha Healthcare Centre in the
OL,20,FDiocese of Liwolo, South Sudan.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
