OL,3,GNEWSABishop and 50 clergy to tackle
OL,4,Amuddy assault course
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll donations for the healthcare centre
OL,7,Fwill help to fund medicines,
OL,8,Fhealthcare, solar lighting, clean water
OL,9,Fand support for frontline medical staff
OL,10,Fserving communities in Liwolo.
